        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 6.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þeah hit sie on middum felda gefohten cxx sciƚƚ to wite sie agifen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And even if the fight takes place in an open field, 120 shillings shall be paid as fine.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And even if it [the fight] takes place in the open, a fine of 120 shillings shall be paid.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ þeah hit sy gefohten on middan felda, CXX scll' to wite sy agifen.</ab>
